        349.1717834472656,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        83.1881103515625,
        513.483642578125,
        96.53961181640625
      ],
      "text": "The Panel also noted that the wording of the above 2010 recommendation might",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        99.18463134765625,
        513.4258422851562,
        112.5361328125
      ],
      "text": "suggest that the recommendation was made solely on the basis of risk of hepatotoxicity.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        115.18115234375,
        513.4261474609375,
        128.53265380859375
      ],
      "text": "This was not intended. In fact, the 2010 recommendation was made on the basis of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        131.17767333984375,
        513.4835815429688,
        144.5291748046875
      ],
      "text": "achieving adequate serum drug levels in children while at the same time ensuring that",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        147.1741943359375,
        513.3799438476562,
        160.52569580078125
      ],
      "text": "there was no increased risk of drug-induced hepatotoxicity as compared with 2006",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        163.17071533203125,
        214.5523681640625,
        176.522216796875
      ],
      "text": "dosage recommendations.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        187.4161376953125,
        161.72140502929688,
        201.04364013671875
      ],
      "text": "Panel decision",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        206.52911376953125,
        513.3915405273438,
        219.880615234375
      ],
      "text": "Recommend that the dosage for isoniazid be 10 mg/kg with the range extended at",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        222.525634765625,
        513.4718627929688,
        235.87713623046875
      ],
      "text": "the lower end as follows: 7-15 mg/kg. Alter the order of words in order to clarify",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        238.52215576171875,
        277.5838928222656,
        251.8736572265625
      ],
      "text": "interpretation of the recommendation.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        263.02862548828125,
        449.4974670410156,
        276.380126953125
      ],
      "text": "The current recommendation was therefore modified by the Panel to read:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        290.05364990234375,
        207.19239807128906,
        303.68115234375
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 8 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        314.859130859375,
        513.460205078125,
        328.48663330078125
      ],
      "text": "The following dosages of anti-TB medicines should be used daily for the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        328.65911865234375,
        251.37545776367188,
        342.28662109375
      ],
      "text": "treatment of TB in children:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        353.464599609375,
        513.4375,
        367.0921630859375
      ],
      "text": "10 mg/kg (range 7–15 mg/kg); maximum dose 300  isoniazid (H)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        367.26458740234375,
        144.42539978027344,
        380.89208984375
      ],
      "text": "mg/day",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        392.0700988769531,
        513.448974609375,
        405.6976318359375
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin (R)\t 15 mg/kg (range 10–20 mg/kg); maximum dose 600",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88737487792969,
        405.8701171875,
        144.4253692626953,
        419.49761962890625
      ],
      "text": "mg/day",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88737487792969,
        430.67559814453125,
        395.2059631347656,
        444.3031311035156
      ],
      "text": "35 mg/kg (range 30–40 mg/kg) pyrazinamide (Z)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        455.4811096191406,
        395.2059631347656,
        469.108642578125
      ],
      "text": "ethambutol (E)\t \t 20 mg/kg (range 15–25 mg/kg)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        475.56011962890625,
        377.2198791503906,
        488.91162109375
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        497.55963134765625,
        513.4490356445312,
        510.9111328125
      ],
      "text": "The recommended range for isoniazid applies to all circumstances when isoniazid is",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        513.5560913085938,
        513.4375610351562,
        526.9075927734375
      ],
      "text": "recommended to be used in children, including a number of recommendations in this",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        529.5526123046875,
        489.9084167480469,
        542.9041137695312
      ],
      "text": "guideline for treatment of active disease as well as for isoniazid preventive therapy.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        554.0591430664062,
        513.448974609375,
        567.41064453125
      ],
      "text": "Other recommendations from the 2010 rapid advice were considered and the Panel",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        570.0556030273438,
        513.3914794921875,
        583.4071044921875
      ],
      "text": "noted that there are no recent data on streptomycin, intermittent regimens or optimal",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        586.0521240234375,
        449.48602294921875,
        599.4036254882812
      ],
      "text": "duration of therapy, including for TB meningitis and osteoarticular disease.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        610.4896240234375,
        513.41455078125,
        623.9100952148438
      ],
      "text": "Rapid advice: treatment of tuberculosis in children  All other recommendations from",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        626.5551147460938,
        513.403076171875,
        639.9066162109375
      ],
      "text": "(Geneva, World Health Organization, 2010) were therefore endorsed by the Panel, with",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        642.482666015625,
        140.0093994140625,
        655.9031372070312
      ],
      "text": "no change .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
