        85.03939819335938,
        666.7821044921875,
        298.4794921875,
        680.4096069335938
      ],
      "text": "Prevention of TB in children (Chapter 5)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
